{
    "id":  11261,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED Track Spotlight 30W PARMA Black Single-Phase Track - CCT - CRI+92 - 48º",
    "reference":  "90781-CCT",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eParma 30W CCT LED Track Spotlight,\u003c/strong\u003e equipped with the \u003cstrong\u003eBridgelux chip\u003c/strong\u003e, offers the option to select between three color temperatures \u003cstrong\u003e(3000K, 4000K, 5700K)\u003c/strong\u003e, adapting to your specific needs and creating the perfect atmosphere.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWith a CRI +92\u003c/strong\u003e, it ensures vibrant, authentic colors that highlight details and provide an immersive, professional atmosphere. Its \u003cstrong\u003e48º\u003c/strong\u003e beam angle allows precise focusing of light on key elements. Perfect for modern and elegant environments.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003ePARMA 30W LED Track Spotlight Black Single-Phase - CCT - CRI+92 - 48º\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover the excellence of the \u003cstrong\u003ePARMA 30W CCT LED Track Spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e. Compact elegant design with outstanding performance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSelectable Color Temperature:\u003c/strong\u003e 3000K, 4000K, 5700K\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh CRI (+92):\u003c/strong\u003e Vibrant authentic colors\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Lens and Reflector:\u003c/strong\u003e PMMA collimator, polished aluminum reflector, 48º beam\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBRIDGELUX COB Diode:\u003c/strong\u003e 2240 DS-C30\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGXtronic NO FLICK Driver:\u003c/strong\u003e 3-year warranty\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnergy Savings:\u003c/strong\u003e Up to 90%\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses: Showcases, offices, art galleries, museums.\u003c/h3\u003e",
